 \u0026 Research\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Pay as you go: $0.008 / credit. Monthly plans: $30 / 4,000 credits; $100 / 15,000; $220 / 38,000; $500 / 100,000. Research Mini uses 4–110 credits per request; Pro uses 15–250.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"Brave: additional endpoints\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Spellcheck and Autosuggest are each $5 / 10,000 requests. Enterprise terms are custom. Answers token charges do not apply to ordinary Search requests.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bill-example\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"A WORKED EXAMPLE\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"20 results can change the math.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"For 1,000 Exa standard searches returning 20 results each: $7 base + $10 for the extra 10,000 results = \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"$$17\"}],\", before credits. LangSearch does not charge per additional result within its supported result count. Returned content still counts toward the daily token allowance.\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1e:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"pricing-choice dark-band\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"site-container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"page-kicker\",\"children\":\"WHY FREE?\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":[\"Put the budget\",\" \",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"into \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"your next idea.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We’re funding LangSearch ourselves, starting with the connection we want our own AI systems to have.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"className\":\"text-action\",\"href\":\"/blog/our-first-round\",\"children\":[\"Read why we’re building this \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 